{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51642","headline":"黄鹤楼（《宋诗纪事》亦未收） · 卢郢","name":"黄鹤楼（《宋诗纪事》亦未收）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄鹤何年去杳冥，高城千载倚江城。\n碧云朝卷四山景，流水夜传三峡声。\n柳暗西州供骋望，草芳南浦徧离情。\n登临一晌须回首，看却乡心万感生。\n（《古今图书集成·职方典》一一二五《武昌府部》）（〖1〗见北宋熙宁间刻《鄂州杂诗碑》，参前「贾岛」条。\n又见《方舆胜览》卷二八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}